			"notes": "# 新内容：\n1. 添加了指令 `/autologin trigger <action>` 来触发各种功能。\n  - 比如，假如你想手动触发欢迎新人，可以使用`/autologin trigger start_greeting` 运行该功能\n 2. 添加了新的菜单来手动运行某个功能，默认使用`U`键打开\n# 更改：\n1. 移除了指令`/autologin claim`。该指令可被`/autologin trigger claim_reward`替代\n# New：\n1. Added new command  `/autologin trigger <action>` to manually trigger various actions.\n  - For example, if you want to manually welcome new players, you can use`/autologin trigger start_greeting` to run this action\n2. Added a new menu to manually trigger an action. Open with `U` by default.\n# Changes：\n1. Removed the command `/autologin claim`, which can be replaced by `/autologin trigger claim_reward`"
		},
